  <item>
    <title>vol040 上头计划｜3.14:破防后我暴走西湖两三圈！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675eeeff84447b1bd012de6e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675eeeff84447b1bd012de6e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Dec 2024 15:11:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>马良@上头马良：被蜜蜂叮过的狗；</span></p><span></span><p><span>颜彦祖@没有故事的颜同学：做人不行；</span></p><span></span><p><span>纹豪@纹豪脱口秀：破防去西湖；</span></p><span></span><p><span>云鹏@活在舞台上的云鹏：非常有天赋；</span></p><span></span><p><span>李涛 也不知道微博叫啥：不以物喜，不以己悲；</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：《活生生的生活》-五条人；</span></p><span></span><p><span>《三点一四》线下播客观众持续招募，感兴趣的朋友，或者喜欢我们播客的朋友可以+v信：sandianyisi2024 加入我们的听友群。</span></p><span></span><p><span>单集简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢上头计划马良来到播客，主播们聊了聊最近的破防的时刻，聊着聊着居然反目成仇，各位快快收听吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听节点：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">03:03</a> 马良破防视频现场放送！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="547">09:07</a> 彦祖打游戏都破防；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 彦祖让纹豪彻底破防两三天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1443">24:03</a> 云鹏破防点只我不能没天赋；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2067">34:27</a> 婚礼的十米长信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2735">45:35</a> 你的生日需求，你的开心时刻，让友情升温！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3282">54:42</a> 教主的头像和六年级的女儿：文豪老师的幽默瞬间引发误解！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3829">01:03:49</a> 崩溃边缘的无能狂怒：兔子、行李箱和租房搬家的折磨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4926">01:22:06</a> 艺术理念不合引发的喜剧合作危机：挑战与欢乐的边界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5472">01:31:12</a> 相声演员之间的矛盾与人际关系：台上台下的真实面貌</span></p><span></span><p><span>现场照片：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnypkk44J6jjj6g46PHIIasS4UIM.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FntCaRGRIZl1g5-crEsVp-PAm9A3.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtsEi0e1SQcxCHSaFsXPfeOLHD1w.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmLDI3euxcNWc4mFwTTDeRhBiTsK.png"></figure>]]></description>
