    <title>Vol.37 震惊！黑灯深夜与友人密会射箭馆 并命中10环</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a3572e33ddcbb53c3f7b40</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a3572e33ddcbb53c3f7b40</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Aug 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>灯灯灯等~！（BGM）黑灯老师难得回杭演出 ，上头计划必须得安排一起叙叙旧，就聊聊最近黑灯爆火的“烦恼‘’——爆火....马良和吴鼎也想像黑灯老师一样变得优秀，这期就聊聊如何能通过奇特的出圈技巧获得爆火的头衔，同时也一起演练一下爆火后可能会遇到的公关事故处理能力。为将来的爆火做好万全的准备。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播阵容】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>回归嘉宾:黑灯@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/5888782993" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/5888782993"><span>黑灯爆火</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>上头主播/策划/主持：马良@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034"><span>上头马良</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>阳光主播：吴鼎@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567"><span>吴鼎顶不住了</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>策划协助/剪辑：咸 @</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707"><span>咸骑小宝贝</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>ED：《转发这条锦鲤》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期内容摘要】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 红计划...</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 我们与那些明星的距离...</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 那些出圈的技巧和成功案例</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 奇怪的炒CP</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 有点名气后遭遇到的烦心事儿</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 出名后如厕也会有负担</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 明星与网红的区别</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> 公关危机的应急处理方案大比拼！</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQKJyP4Av-aJWuDh-0NUUHiXveV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【感谢 点赞 订阅 转发 收藏 打赏】</span></strong></p>]]></description>
