    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a124c17349f7a5574dc6c9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a124c17349f7a5574dc6c9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Jul 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>民以食为天！咸妻良母近期频频亲自下厨招待上头计划的主播们聚餐</span><br><span>索性一起交流一下做饭相关的心得：南北菜系的差异，厨房翻车的故事，以及那些厨房好物推荐</span><br><span>上头计划希望各位在炎热的夏天 也依然能有一个好胃口...</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播阵容】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>上头主播：马良@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034"><span>上头马良</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>炸厨主播:B仔@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1825240145" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1825240145"><span>B仔不是逼崽</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>策划/主持/阳光主播：吴鼎@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567"><span>吴鼎顶不住了</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>剪辑：咸 @</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707"><span>咸骑小宝贝</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>ED：《曲奇陷阱》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期内容摘要】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 身边的大厨</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 烹饪技能发展史</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 电视节目里的厨艺比拼</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 第一次下厨的经历</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 浅浅谈下南北菜系的差异</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 厨房翻车记录</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 黑暗料理的复盘</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 因为下厨结缔下的友谊</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 学做菜得先学做狠人</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">64:00</a> 好用的下厨技巧/工具分享</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQKJyP4Av-aJWuDh-0NUUHiXveV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【感谢 点赞 订阅 转发 收藏 打赏】</span></strong></p>]]><