    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Jul 2024 16:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>炎炎夏日下的上头计划本期主题来聊一下【暑假】 其实是咸挺想参与的一期内容，</span><br><span>但无奈年龄代沟摆在那里，太多的暑期回忆怕说出来被人笑话，</span><br><span>虽然剪的时候发现各位主播们童年的暑期回忆其实也大差不差，各位听友们对暑假的回忆有哪些 欢迎评论区告诉我们！！</span><br><span> </span><strong><span>【本期主播阵容】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>上头主播/策划/主持：马良@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034"><span>上头马良</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>主播:B仔@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1825240145" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1825240145"><span>B仔不是逼崽</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>阳光主播：吴鼎@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567"><span>吴鼎顶不住了</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>剪辑：咸 @</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707"><span>咸骑小宝贝</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>ED：《夏天》——李玖哲</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期内容摘要】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 南北暑假差异？</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 有些猪只能陪你走一段路</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 儿时暑假美食冷饮回忆录</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 暑假的饮料就是汽水儿！</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 儿时暑假的冲浪记忆</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 暑假的专属BGM</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 无法逃脱的暑期补习班</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 暑期的魔幻游历经历</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 浅谈暑假的来历</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">64:00</a> 暑假作业哪家强 同学组团找马良</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4440">74:00</a> 畅想未来的暑假规划</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【往期播客推荐】</span></strong></p><span></spa