  <item>
    <title>Vol.32 到底谁该来为&quot;熊孩子&quot;买单?</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667ed4415c33fe90f58bc8ac</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667ed4415c33fe90f58bc8ac</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Jun 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上头计划开播至今，其实聊了好多强关联的话题 教育 父母 教师 校园，但一直没聊“罪魁祸首”</span><br><span>——B仔 （啊不是） 熊孩子....</span><br><span>如何应付“熊孩子”，一直是个永远热闹的话题。有人主张严惩不贷，也有人耐心对待，我个人最厌恶的是那些理中客：“孩子毕竟是孩子，熊是常情”那是自己没摊上！！</span><br><span>本期就来悉数一下童年的熊人熊事 不一定有营养 但还是有一些小巧思. </span><br><span>欢迎各位评论区留言自己的一些治理熊孩子的方法 给大家分享分享</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>上头主播：马良@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034"><span>上头马良</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>熊崽主播/策划/主持:B仔@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1825240145" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1825240145"><span>B仔不是逼崽</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>阳光主播：吴鼎@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567"><span>吴鼎顶不住了</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>剪辑：咸 @</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707"><span>咸骑小宝贝</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>ED：《狗熊》——窦靖童</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【本期内容摘要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 公共交通上的熊孩已让人麻木</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> B仔治孩子的方式超恐怖</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 文明观演的重要性不论年龄</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 咱们自己的忍耐底线到底在哪</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 超熊行为...</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> 主播们童年的仿熊行为</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 吴鼎讲述飞踹熊孩子的故事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> B仔儿时是恶童 罪行罄竹难书</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> “小偷家族”的家庭内斗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 校园Shi记</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> 阿鲁巴的最高礼仪是国杠...</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3660">61:00</a> 鼎子细说山西校园帮派发展史</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">70:00</a> 校园暴力的常用工具</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4500">75:00</a> 成长之后看到校服坏小孩都绕道走</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">80:00</a> 解决冲突的方案是随着年龄迭代更新的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5220">87:00</a> 熊孩子的问题还是在于熊家长...</span></p><span></span><p><span>【往期播客推荐】</span></p><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66733707c26e396a3600e16e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66733707c26e396a3600e16e"><span>Vol.32 校园早恋故事有多抓马 30年教龄老师现身来说法</span></a><br><span></span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/666c73e9b6a8412729d4e5b6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/666c73e9b6a8412729d4e5b6"><span>Vol.30 数理化一考就废 杭州话一听就醉</span></a><span> </span><br><span></span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/663e6dd9b813c7172b3c2004" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/663e6dd9b813c7172b3c2004"><span>Vol.25 真正的教育，不是培养只知道“标准答案”的人。</span></a></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQKJyP4Av-aJWuDh-0NUUHiXveV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【感谢 点赞 订阅 转发 收藏 打赏】</span></p>]]></description>
