    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>之前聊过太多期校园、教育相关的话题，发现有许多朋友对校园、老师都存在或多或少的不理解，</span><br><span>今天我们特别邀请来了马良的初中英语老师杨老师，作为一个拥有30年教书育人经验的人民教师，今天和大家一起来分享一下她的视角。</span><strong><br><span>【本期主播阵容】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>嘉宾：杨老师</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>上头主播/策划/主持：马良@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034"><span>上头马良</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>早恋主播：B仔@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1825240145" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1825240145"><span>B仔不是逼崽</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>阳光主播：吴鼎@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567"><span>吴鼎顶不住了</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>剪辑：咸 @</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707"><span>咸骑小宝贝</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>ED：《驯化》——暴躁的兔子</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期内容摘要】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 时隔多年再加老师好友</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> 老师也不想上课 </span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 老师不经意的一句话可能会影响一生</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 早恋也是教学利器</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 时代不同了 现在学生早恋全是荷尔蒙</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 老师排座位到底用什么标准</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 老师与学生之间的那些拉扯...</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">63:00</a> 学校的规章制度的由来...</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">72:00</a> 老师的耐心也有限 自己的孩子难平衡</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【往期播客推荐】</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/666c73e9b6a8412729d4e5b6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/666c73e9b6a8412729d4e5b6"><span>Vol.30 数理化一考就废 杭州话一听就醉</span></a><br><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6659658594977a26ef31f644" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6659658594977a26ef31f644"><span>Vol.28 抽象人类实验室传出沃尔沃边上的哭泣声</span></a><br><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/663e6dd9b813c7172b3c2004" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/663e6dd9b813c7172b3c2004"><span>Vol.25 真正的教育，不是培养只知道“标准答案”的人。</span></a></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQKJyP4Av-aJWuDh-0NUUHiXveV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【感谢 点赞 订阅 转发 收藏 打赏】</span></strong></p>]]></description>
