    <title>Vol.28 抽象人类实验室传出沃尔沃边上的哭泣声</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6659658594977a26ef31f644</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6659658594977a26ef31f644</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Jun 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>抽象不仅仅是形式，也是对形式更迭的记叙</span><br><span>更是艺术家对社会、政治和文化变迁作出的一系列反应</span><br><span>抽象是一种从繁琐的事物中，舍弃个别的、非本质的属性，抽出共同的、本质的属性，形成概念的手段</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你看不懂上述内容 恭喜你还是一个正常人类 ... 本期就来聊聊抽象。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播阵容】：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>本地嘉宾：空空@悟空小碎嘴</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>上头主播/策划/主持：马良@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034"><span>上头马良</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>抽象主播：吴鼎@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567"><span>吴鼎顶不住了</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>中年主播/剪辑：咸 @</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707"><span>咸骑小宝贝</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期摘要】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 渴望抽象的咸</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 抽象的慢问慢答中的快问快答</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 马良幼年留遗书</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 抽象人类重灾区</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 空空上1818黄金眼</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2600">43:20</a> 相亲节目里的金句..</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 马良家里的一台戏</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">63:00</a> 60年的信仰动摇了</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">67:00</a> 很怪很怪的怪癖</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4440">74:00</a> 抽象且讽刺的面试</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【往期播客推荐】</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/664fabb24efbc0c3dca717ee" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/664fabb24efbc0c3dca717ee"><span>Vol.26 王炸冠军林简七说：我就不爱参加比赛</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/663e6dd9b813c7172b3c2004" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/663e6dd9b813c7172b3c2004"><span>Vol.25 真正的教育，不是培养只知道“标准答案”的人</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6633bbce03bcdd73a932e717" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6633bbce03bcdd73a932e717"><span>Vol.24 教练!~我想做播客...</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/662914e2ff598d65f20090db" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/662914e2ff598d65f20090db"><span>Vol.23 我人生最大的豪赌是在杭州理发</span></a></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQKJyP4Av-aJWuDh-0NUUHiXveV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【感谢 点赞 订阅 转发 收藏 打赏】</span></strong></p>]]></description>
