    <guid isPermaLink="false">664fabb24efbc0c3dca717ee</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 May 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上头计划线下市集三天终于结束了 近期所有主播的日程都很满，忙完市集仍要继续做收尾工作的马良，刚参加（淘汰）完比赛的B仔，准备上节目（火）的吴鼎，工具人咸... 没精力搞策划和选主题，但不能厚着脸皮断更，索性就有了这一期...</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播阵容】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>闲聊主播：B仔@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1825240145" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1825240145"><span>B仔不是逼崽</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>咸聊主播/剪辑：咸 @</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707"><span>咸骑小宝贝</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>上头主播：马良@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034"><span>上头马良</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>阳光主播：吴鼎@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567"><span>吴鼎顶不住了</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>策划：无...</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>ED：《Try Everything》——Shakira</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期内容摘要】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> 上头计划市集的筹办过程简述</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 那些有趣的朋友们</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 已被克服的那些小挫折</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 下次活动的一些小畅想</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a> B仔的神奇排队经历</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2005">33:25</a> 咸的近况与一些小思考</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 上头计划竟然被人抄袭了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> 吴鼎看电影引自我哲思...</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 吴鼎看的电影剧情防剧透跳过点</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> B仔看的电影剧情防剧透跳过点</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">67:00</a> B仔推荐音乐作品分享</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">70:00</a> 吴鼎推荐音乐作品分享</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">72:00</a> 马良推荐迪士尼BGM</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【咸的地道战大队长照片补充说明】</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FseAPkjN5a5haSX3txBQi0MMpJ0F.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtuJYDW-zkpv1clTYwUKL_zMV-RA.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【B仔推荐歌曲】</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Athletics-《who you are is not enough》</span><br><span>pg.lost</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>【吴鼎推荐歌曲】</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>《工厂》 - 河南说唱之神</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>【往期播客推荐】</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66472b1c82b428eafd45c2be" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66472b1c82b428eafd45c2be"><span>Vol.26 王炸冠军林简七说：我就不爱参加比赛</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/663e6dd9b813c7172b3c2004" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/663e6dd9b813c7172b3c2004"><span>Vol.25 真正的教育，不是培养只知道“标准答案”的人</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6633bbce03bcdd73a932e717" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6633bbce03bcdd73a932e717"><span>Vol.24 教练!~我想做播客...</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/662914e2ff598d65f20090db" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/662914e2ff598d65f20090db"><span>Vol.23 我人生最大的豪赌是在杭州理发</span></a></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQKJyP4Av-aJWuDh-0NUUHiXveV.jpg