    <title>Vol.26 王炸冠军林简七说：我就不爱参加比赛</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66472b1c82b428eafd45c2be</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66472b1c82b428eafd45c2be</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 May 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期邀请到了喜剧联盒国王炸比赛冠军演员林简七做客上头计划一起聊聊关于[比赛]的那些故事</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播阵容】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>冠军嘉宾：林简七@</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3710767162" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3710767162"><span>林简七</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>阳光主播：吴鼎@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/5631936567"><span>吴鼎顶不住了</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>上头主播：马良@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1785798034"><span>上头马良</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>竞技主播/策划：B仔@</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1825240145" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1825240145"><span>B仔不是逼崽</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>主持/策划/剪辑：咸 @</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1076203707"><span>咸骑小宝贝</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>ED：《海阔天空》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期内容摘要】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 各自获得过的比赛荣誉</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 主播们的游戏战绩</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 参加比赛的原因和初衷</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 我们是不是爱比的人...</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 为了上线上比赛 演员做了哪些事？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 那些不理解的比赛</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 看比赛到底在看淘汰还是看夺冠？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 比赛失利如何安慰自己？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【演出/演员推荐】</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsz_rTsq6dMsd-hSXLUMUkmtcR-7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>林简七获奖时刻记录....</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家最近关注 南京无名喜剧 </span><br><span>即将有 林简七与他... 曾经的好哥们儿 高寒 的双拼演出近期开票。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【往期播客推荐】</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/663e6dd9b813c7172b3c2004" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/663e6dd9b813c7172b3c2004"><span>Vol.25 真正的教育，不是培养只知道“标准答案”的人</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6633bbce03bcdd73a932e717" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6633bbce03bcdd73a932e717"><span>Vol.24 教练!~我想做播客...</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/662914e2ff598d65f20090db" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/662914e2ff598d65f20090db"><span>Vol.23 我人生最大的豪赌是在杭州理发</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/662129505dae7932c6618b56" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/662129505dae7932c6618b56"><span>Vol.22 社交隐私的主防对象 其实就是自己家长</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/660693ec1519139e4f610706" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/660693ec1519139e4f610706"><span>Vol.21 童年每天都是愚人劫 成人苟活在楚门的世界</span></a></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQKJyP4Av-aJWuDh-0NUUHiXveV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【感谢 点赞 订阅 转发 收藏 打赏】</span></strong></p>]]></description>
